title: KPO — money, milestones and credit

@kpo_payment_dossier_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — The action plan is correctly separated from a transfer, the coalition's KPO committee is a room with named people arguing in it, and all five routes now write a persistent ownership record: a common ledger that binds its authors, an earmark raid that names the party it is taken from, a fortnight bought with somebody else's signature, and two opposition instruments honest about their own thinness.
title: The KPO payment dossier
subtitle: An action plan is not yet a transfer, and €59.8 billion expires in August 2026.
